# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities.
version: v1.25.1
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          braces has no fixed version: 3.0.3 is the latest published release and every version is
          affected (CVE-2026-93687). It reaches this project only through Sanity's CLI tooling
          (micromatch, chokidar and fast-glob below @sanity/cli and @sanity/codegen), which expands
          glob patterns from this repository's own configuration and never outside input. Revisit
          once braces publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-ZOD-20510278:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          zod has no fixed version: 4.6.5 is the latest published release and every version up to
          it is affected (CVE-2023-54404); the upstream fix, colinhacks/zod#6475, was closed
          unmerged. The studio is a static single-page app: zod runs in the Sanity CLI and in the
          editor's own browser, and no outside input reaches a server through it. Revisit once zod
          publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
